WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.240
then we'll be looking at the Millennium

00:00:05.240 --> 00:00:08.760
Powerhouse and the importance of the

00:00:08.760 --> 00:00:14.080
Millennium Powerhouse in dealing with
young people in the area

00:00:14.080 --> 00:00:15.500
and it's built

00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:21.780
on the same spot as the original Moss Side
Youth

00:00:21.780 --> 00:00:24.940
Club. We'll be looking at the

00:00:24.940 --> 00:00:28.900
West Indian Sports and Social Club which
is just on the road which

00:00:28.900 --> 00:00:29.980
was set up in

00:00:29.980 --> 00:00:35.500
1953 and it was the first, it's the
longest lasting

00:00:35.500 --> 00:00:37.880
West Indian club in the

00:00:37.880 --> 00:00:39.520
country at the moment.
